@startuml
title DrunkGraph - Secuencia de autenticacion y provisionamiento

actor Usuario
participant "Next.js Web" as Web
participant "FusionAuth" as FusionAuth
participant "Spring API" as API
participant "Spring Security" as Security
participant "ProvisioningJwtAuthenticationConverter" as Converter
participant "ProvisionUserUseCase" as UseCase
participant "Neo4jUserProvisioningAdapter" as Adapter
database "Neo4j" as Neo4j

Usuario -> Web: Inicia sesion
Web -> FusionAuth: Redireccion OAuth
FusionAuth --> Web: JWT / sesion

Usuario -> Web: Ejecuta accion protegida
Web -> API: Request con Authorization: Bearer JWT
API -> Security: Validar token
Security -> FusionAuth: Obtener JWKS si es necesario
FusionAuth --> Security: Llaves publicas
Security -> Converter: convert(jwt)

Converter -> UseCase: execute(sub, email, name)
UseCase -> Adapter: provision(sub, email, name)
Adapter -> Neo4j: MERGE (u:User {id: sub})\nON CREATE SET alias, email, defaults
Neo4j --> Adapter: OK
Adapter --> UseCase: OK
UseCase --> Converter: OK
Converter --> Security: JwtAuthenticationToken
Security --> API: Solicitud autenticada
API --> Web: Respuesta del endpoint
Web --> Usuario: Actualiza UI

@enduml

